    <bpmn:process id="W_W1382" name="W1382. Customer Electronic Payment (PESONet/InstaPay) Reconciliation &amp; Auto-Application" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer makes electronic payment via PESONet, InstaPay, or bank-to-bank transfer; daily bank statement or payment notification received
Frequency: Daily; ~140–200 electronic payments/day across 5 entities (≈35,000–50,000/year at ~250 business days, per the Volume)
Volume: ~35,000–50,000 electronic payments/year; growing ~20–30% annually as customers shift from checks
Owner: AR Clerk
Participants: AR Clerk, AR Supervisor, Treasury Analyst, Customer
Source: workflow W1382 — Customer Electronic Payment (PESONet/InstaPay) Reconciliation &amp; Auto-Application</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1382_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1382_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1382_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1382_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1382_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1382_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1382_Lane2" name="AR Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1382_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1382_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1382_Lane3" name="AR Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1382_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1382_Lane4" name="GL Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1382_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1382_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1382_Start6" name="Customer makes electronic payment via PESONet, InstaPay, or bank-to-bank transfer; daily…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1382_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1382_Task7" name="System receives daily electronic payment data from bank: (a) PESONet batch file…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System receives daily electronic payment data from bank: (a) PESONet batch file — customer name, amount, reference number, date; (b) InstaPay real-time notifications via bank API; (c) direct bank-to-bank transfer confirmations from online banking
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1382_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1382_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1382_Task8" name="Auto-matching engine attempts to match each payment to open AR invoices: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Auto-matching engine attempts to match each payment to open AR invoices: (a) matches on customer name + exact amount → auto-apply; (b) matches on reference number containing invoice number → auto-apply; (c) matches on customer name + amount within tolerance (±5%) → flag for manual review; (d) no match found → route to unapplied cash queue
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1382_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1382_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1382_Task9" name="For auto-matched payments (estimated 60–70% match rate): system posts AR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For auto-matched payments (estimated 60–70% match rate): system posts AR application — Dr. Cash / Cr. Accounts Receivable; invoice status updated to &quot;Paid&quot;; customer AR balance reduced; system sends payment confirmation to customer via email/SMS
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1382_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1382_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1382_Task10" name="For unmatched payments (estimated 30–40%): AR Clerk reviews unapplied cash…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: For unmatched payments (estimated 30–40%): AR Clerk reviews unapplied cash queue daily — (a) check customer bank statement details for invoice references or project names; (b) cross-reference with customer&#x27;s recent email or phone communication about payment; (c) contact customer to confirm which invoices the payment covers; (d) manually apply payment to correct invoices
Responsible (R): AR Clerk
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor
Duration: 5–10 min/payment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1382_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1382_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1382_Task11" name="For partial payments: AR Clerk applies payment to invoices per customer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: For partial payments: AR Clerk applies payment to invoices per customer instruction; if no instruction: apply to oldest invoices first (FIFO); remaining balance stays open in AR aging
Responsible (R): AR Clerk
Accountable (A): AR Supervisor
Duration: 5 min/payment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1382_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1382_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1382_Task12" name="Weekly: AR Supervisor reviews unapplied cash aging — any payment unapplied for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Weekly: AR Supervisor reviews unapplied cash aging — any payment unapplied for &gt; 5 business days escalated to AR Supervisor for resolution; unapplied cash &gt; 30 days flagged for Finance Manager review
Responsible (R): AR Supervisor
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 30 min/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1382_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1382_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1382_Task13" name="Monthly: GL Accountant reconciles electronic payment bank statements to GL cash…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly: GL Accountant reconciles electronic payment bank statements to GL cash postings per W89, independent of payment execution; identifies and resolves discrepancies
Responsible (R): GL Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Part of W89</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1382_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1382_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1382_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1382_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1382_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-288 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Payment &amp; Settlement (PA-16.3).) | - operational: AR Clerk review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: AR Clerk</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
